/given-names></name><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>BH</given-names></name><name><surname>Bennett</surname><given-names>MI</given-names></name><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>AJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The epidemiology of chronic pain of predominantly neuropathic origin. Results from a general population survey</article-title><source>J Pain</source><year>2006</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>281</fpage><lpage>289</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16618472</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.jpain.2005.11.008</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hall</surname><given-names>GC</given-names></name><name><surname>Carroll</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Parry</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>McQuay</surname><given-names>HJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Epidemiology and treatment of neuropathic pain: The UK primary care perspective</article-title><source>Pain</source><year>2006</year><volume>122</volume><fpage>156</fpage><lpage>162</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16545908</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.pain.2006.01.030</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>MHRA</collab></person-group><article-title>Co-proxamol: outcome of the review of risks and benefits</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.mhra.gov.uk/home/idcplg?IdcService=GET_FILE&#x00026;dDocName=CON019462&#x00026;RevisionSelectionMethod=Latest"/></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Department of Health</collab></person-group><article-title>PRODIGY Guidance - Shingles and postherpetic neuralgia</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://cks.library.nhs.uk/shingles_postherpetic_pain/"/></c